# Navigation

Routes live in `lib/routing/routes.dart` with `go_router` and `go_router_builder`.

```dart
@TypedGoRoute<HomeRoute>(path: '/home')
class HomeRoute extends GoRouteData with $HomeRoute {
  const HomeRoute();

  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context, GoRouterState state) => const HomePage();
}
```

- `part 'routes.g.dart';` and `List<RouteBase> get routes => $appRoutes;`
- `App` builds one `GoRouter(routes: routes, initialLocation: initialLocation)`
- After adding or changing a route, run `fvm dart run melos run build_runner --no-select`
- Navigate with the generated route: `ArticleRoute(source, $extra: model).go(context)`
- Path parameters and `$extra` belong on the `GoRouteData` class
- Top-level experiments can be a `HomePage` tab instead of a new route
